<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:a2cd582b-3dfc-4ed4-a2e2-2689961a7bd6">
              <SHORT-NAME>ComM</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the ComM (Communications Manager) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComM（Communication Manager）模块负责管理ECU中的通信网络接口的状态，确保根据车辆的不同操作模式调整网络接口的行为。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：ComM配置必须与ECU支持的网络接口和通信协议一致；确保与Nm（网络管理）、EcuM（ECU管理）等其他管理模块的正确交互；在配置时应考虑系统的功耗和唤醒策略。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00890</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b99721da-102c-4cc0-9c83-c98463c2e955">
                  <SHORT-NAME>ComMConfigSet</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters and sub containers of the AUTOSAR ComM module.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMConfigSet 是一个配置容器，包含了用于通信管理（ComM）模块的参数集合，这些参数定义了网络管理策略、通信模式和用户请求处理。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMConfigSet时，必须确保所有的网络通道（Channels）和用户（Users）都被正确配置；每个ComMChannel需要至少一个ComMUser；配置参数应符合ECU的网络管理需求和硬件能力。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00879</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f1435a9f-e043-47f2-8b3d-f55d9e9a9609">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMPncEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether in this configuration set the partial networking is enabled.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMPncEnabled是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用部分网络集群（Partial Network Cluster）的功能，这是通信堆栈中的一个特性，用于控制ECU的网络管理行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在使用此配置项时，ECU的网络管理需求与部分网络集群功能相匹配；如果ECU不支持部分网络集群功能，则不应启用此配置项；在配置时，应考虑与其他网络管理配置项的兼容性和一致性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled
                                        false: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00878</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:90795662-87ac-4770-b3db-ea5b1b699d62">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMChannel</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration (parameters) of the bus channel(s). The channel parameters shall be harmonized within the whole communication stack.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMChannel是指通信管理模块中的通信通道，用于管理ECU内部或与其他ECU之间的网络通信状态，确保网络通信的可靠性和高效性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMChannel时，需要确保其与ECU支持的网络接口类型相匹配；每个ComMChannel应唯一对应一个物理或虚拟的网络通道；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，对ComMChannel的配置参数和行为有详细规定，需要遵循这些规定以保证兼容性和性能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00565</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>256</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5fc93aa9-f6aa-44c3-89de-82c4f5707088">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMFullCommRequestNotificationEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines if the optional SenderReceiver Port of Interface ComM_CurrentChannelRequest will be provided for this channel.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMFullCommRequestNotificationEnabled 是一个布尔配置项，用于启用或禁用通信管理器（ComM）模块中全通信模式请求的通知功能。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保此配置项与系统设计需求一致，如果系统需要在请求全通信模式时接收通知，则应启用此功能；此配置项的默认值通常取决于具体的通信需求和ECU资源限制；在配置此项时，应考虑与其他BswM或ECUM的交互，以确保通信状态管理的正确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">True means enabled. False means disabled</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00787</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:17917b15-1312-4f24-82d0-b7a10bb15f1b">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMNoCom</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Not allowed to change state of ComM channel to COMM_SILENT_COMMUNICATION or COMM_FULL_COMMUNICATION.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMNoCom 是一个配置参数，用于定义通信管理模块（ComM）在无通信模式（No Communication Mode）下的行为，控制网络接口的通信能力。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保正确配置以避免网络节点在不应该通信的时候进行数据传输；此模式通常用于降低能耗或满足特定的系统安全需求；在实施时需考虑与其他通信管理模式的协调和切换逻辑。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled - Not allowed to switch to Communication Modes above.
                                                false: Disabled - Allowed to switch Communication Modes above.

                                                Shall be possible to change parameter during runtime with ComM API's.
                                                ECU/All channels: ComM_LimitECUToNoComMode().
                                                Separate channels: ComM_LimitChannelToNoComMode().</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00571</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a0280203-5946-4765-a644-7bd991eefc77">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMNoWakeup</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines if an ECU is not allowed to wake-up the channel.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMNoWakeup用于指定通信管理模块（ComM）在没有唤醒事件发生时的行为，主要用于控制网络管理逻辑以减少能耗。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMNoWakeup时，需要确保与ECU的低功耗需求相匹配；此配置项对于实现车辆的休眠模式和唤醒策略至关重要；不正确的配置可能导致网络无法按预期进入低功耗状态或唤醒。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled (not allowed to wake-up))
                                                false: Disabled

                                                This is the default/init value of a runtime variable that can be changed during runtime using ComM_PreventWakeUp().</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00569</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:caf4d31a-18b3-4294-a662-c1d088e5ecf5">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMNoWakeUpInhibitionNvmStorage</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">If this parameter is set to &quot;true&quot;, the NoWakeUp inhibition state of the channel shall be stored (in some implementation specific way) in the block pointed to by ComMGlobalNvmBlockDescriptor.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMNoWakeUpInhibitionNvmStorage 用于配置是否将通信管理器（ComM）的无唤醒抑制状态存储在非易失性存储器（NVM）中。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，此配置项确保在系统重启后，无唤醒抑制状态能够被恢复，从而维持网络管理的连续性；正确配置此项可以避免车辆在某些情况下无法唤醒的问题；应根据项目具体需求决定是否启用此功能。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00789</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:65ce688f-3deb-4005-832a-8ee8283a38c8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMBusType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Identifies the bus type of the channel.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMBusType配置项用于定义通信管理模块（ComM）所管理的网络类型，例如CAN、LIN或者Ethernet，以确保正确的网络管理策略被应用。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMBusType时，必须确保所选网络类型与实际项目中使用的网络类型一致；不同的网络类型可能需要不同的配置参数和管理策略；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持多种网络类型，但具体实现细节可能因供应商而异。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00567</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>COMM_BUS_TYPE_CAN</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:da5e5451-e9da-9553-6ef8-2fcf48049fc3">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_BUS_TYPE_CAN</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:e5af5255-8488-94c7-62ab-b4d0cf2fd101">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_BUS_TYPE_CDD</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b04efb38-ac34-8c42-36f2-ba1659ee6157">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_BUS_TYPE_ETH</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f43be9ad-ccf5-8e96-5789-e003a98c2646">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_BUS_TYPE_FR</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:d98d4aa1-4aec-8a47-6692-5f3b9a4f25cc">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_BUS_TYPE_INTERNAL</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:554c7c91-880c-8ff2-4967-fa3ae4be401d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_BUS_TYPE_LIN</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b0f7f164-57d2-47c8-8167-1bba23ba1cd8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMPncGatewayType</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Identifies the Partial Network Gateway behaviour of a ComMChannel.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMPncGatewayType 配置项定义了部分网络（Partial Network）通信网关的类型，用于控制和管理部分网络请求和释放，以优化网络的能耗。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMPncGatewayType时，需要确保它与系统中实际使用的部分网络类型相匹配；此配置项对于实现网络管理策略至关重要，因此需要仔细规划和验证；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当参照相关的通信管理模块来配置此项，以确保兼容性和正确性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00842</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>COMM_GATEWAY_TYPE_ACTIVE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:0bb518cf-1ffe-8d97-7139-58264eb7b453">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_GATEWAY_TYPE_ACTIVE</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:f7d7043b-2f90-8ad3-59f3-5600affb1603">
                              <SHORT-NAME>COMM_GATEWAY_TYPE_PASSIVE</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2bdc3b86-fad7-4474-a8c8-6b0186779b9f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMMainFunctionPeriod</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the period in seconds that the MainFunction has to be triggered with.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMMainFunctionPeriod配置项定义了通信管理主函数(ComM_MainFunction)的调用周期，单位为毫秒。这个周期决定了通信管理模块检查网络管理需求和状态变化的频率。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值需要根据ECU的实际需求和网络管理策略来配置，以确保系统的响应性和效率；过小的周期可能会增加系统的负载，而过大的周期可能导致网络状态反应不够及时；在配置时需要考虑与其他BswM模块的周期性调用的协调。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUint">s</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Comment: ComM scheduling shall be at least as fast as the communication stack and a schedule longer than 100ms makes no sense for communication.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00556</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0.01</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="OPEN">Inf</MAX>
                          <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="OPEN">0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cb043376-bcae-41fa-991d-de06f78c3aaf">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMChannelId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Channel identification number of the corresponding channel.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMChannelId 是一个配置项，用于唯一标识通信管理模块（ComM）中的通信通道，它关联了网络层的通道与ComM模块。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：ComMChannelId 必须是唯一的，以确保每个通信通道都能被正确识别和管理；在配置时应确保其与网络层的通道配置相匹配；在整个系统中，应避免ComMChannelId的重复配置，以防止通信冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00635</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:50ca2f58-6059-4ee9-ba5e-7066c3d8a7ec">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMCDDBusPrefix</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Prefix to be used for API calls to CDD.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMCDDBusPrefix 是一个配置参数，用于定义通信管理模块（ComM）中，与CAN数据总线相关的标识符前缀，以便在生成代码时区分不同的网络通道。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需保证前缀的唯一性，以避免在多网络环境中的命名冲突；前缀应简短且具有描述性，以便于理解和维护；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项符合命名规范和项目实际需求。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00888</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
