                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:fe18e019-1dc0-4fcb-818a-6e88f759c44f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMNetworkManagement</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration parameters of the networkmanagement.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMNetworkManagement 是一个配置项，用于定义通信管理模块（ComM）如何与网络管理（Nm）接口交互，以控制网络节点的状态和通信。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMNetworkManagement时，需要确保它与所使用的网络管理协议（如 CAN NM, FR NM, LIN NM 等）兼容；此外，应当注意配置正确的网络通道标识符，以确保网络管理正确地控制对应的网络节点；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循相关的模块间接口定义和行为规范。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00607</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:effa8797-5912-4db6-96f1-ebb32ff15a4e">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ComMPncNmRequest</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">If this parameter equals true then every time a FULL Communication is requested due to a change in the PNC state machine to COMM_PNC_REQUESTED Nm shall be called using the API Nm_NetworkRequest.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMPncNmRequest 配置项用于定义网络管理请求的处理方式，确保车辆网络在需要时能够快速地进行状态转换。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMPncNmRequest时，必须确保与车辆的网络管理策略一致；此配置项应与其他网络管理配置项协同工作，以避免配置冲突；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中对此配置项的具体参数和行为有详细规定，需要仔细遵守标准。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00886</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                            </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:26eeb597-a431-438b-bf4b-e3e94b449731">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ComMNmVariant</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the functionality of the networkmanagement.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMNmVariant配置项用于定义网络管理（Nm）的变体，指定了车辆网络管理策略的类型，如是否使用CAN网络管理、GATEWAY网络管理等。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在选择ComMNmVariant时，需确保其与项目中实际使用的网络管理策略相匹配；若项目中使用了多种网络管理策略，需要为每种策略正确配置对应的变体；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对网络管理的配置和实现有详细规定，需仔细遵守以保证系统的兼容性和稳定性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">Shall be harmonized with NM configuration.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00568</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>FULL</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <LITERALS>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:522ee0d4-3f70-9229-02a4-cde04dacf646">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>FULL</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:4baf61bd-c979-9dba-1132-38240371197b">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>LIGHT</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:ef325160-5190-923b-3b36-15144d95761f">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>LINSLAVE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:1da64f5e-2e65-9801-3302-966f911f9072">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>NONE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                                <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:cab8ae48-caf7-9361-27ad-74f42adb099e">
                                  <SHORT-NAME>PASSIVE</SHORT-NAME>
                                  <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                                </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                              </LITERALS>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d4d7b08e-0dbf-4558-bad7-70c29e72889a">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ComMNmLightTimeout</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Defines the timeout (in seconds) after COMM_FULL_COMMUNICATION sub-state COMM_FULL_COM_READY_SLEEP is left.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMNmLightTimeout配置项用于定义网络管理轻量级模式下，节点等待网络管理消息的超时时间，以确保网络稳定性和节点同步。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值需根据网络的实际情况和性能要求谨慎设置，以避免因超时设置不当导致的网络通信问题；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与网络管理策略和其他相关配置项协同工作；超时时间设置过短可能导致频繁的网络管理状态切换，设置过长可能影响网络的响应速度。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <ADMIN-DATA>
                                <SDGS>
                                  <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                    <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUint">s</SD>
                                  </SDG>
                                </SDGS>
                              </ADMIN-DATA>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">The range shall be greater than 0.0 and less or equal to 255.0.</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00606</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
