                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <DEFAULT-VALUE>10</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                              <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">255</MAX>
                              <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:58549c51-4697-4a43-b94d-6417b3e4fa46">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMUserPerChannel</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This container contains a list of identifiers that are needed to refer to a user in the system which is linked to a channel.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMUserPerChannel 配置项定义了通信管理器（ComM）中用户和网络通道之间的关系，用于指定哪些用户需要哪些通道来进行通信。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保每个用户至少映射到一个通道；用户和通道之间的映射关系应当遵循实际的通信需求和硬件架构；在多通道系统中，正确的用户到通道的映射对于网络管理和优化资源使用至关重要。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00657</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6b08cbd2-a09b-40fb-9872-291825c1f312">
                              <SHORT-NAME>ComMUserChannel</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the ComMUser that corresponds to this channel user.</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMUserChannel配置项用于定义用户和网络通道之间的关系，确保通信管理模块（ComM）能够根据用户的请求管理网络通道的状态。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMUserChannel时，必须确保每个用户至少映射到一个网络通道；用户和网络通道之间的关系应当符合实际的通信需求；在配置过程中应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于用户和通道关系的规定，以确保配置的有效性和一致性。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <INTRODUCTION>
                                <P>
                                  <L-1 L="EN">ImplementationType: COMM_UserHandleType</L-1>
                                </P>
                              </INTRODUCTION>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00658</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
