                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:17e918b2-c76d-4759-bcf8-d21a596a0889">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMPnc</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of the partial network cluster (PNC).</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMPnc 配置项用于管理部分网络通信（Partial Network Communication）的设置，包括PNC的激活和去激活策略。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMPnc时，必须确保与车辆网络的其他部分兼容，特别是与ECU的网络管理功能；PNC设置应遵循AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的网络管理策略；正确配置PNC可以帮助降低网络的能耗，提高效率。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00843</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>56</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1643dcc8-5f57-4824-9f2b-3cb688295e53">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMPncId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Partial network cluster identification number.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMPncId是用于标识PDU（协议数据单元）中特定的部分网络通信（Partial Network Communication）的ID，它允许在AUTOSAR COM层中配置和管理基于部分网络的通信需求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：PncId的值必须在系统中唯一，以避免配置冲突；在设计时需确保PncId与系统中其他网络管理元素的标识符相协调；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对PncId的具体数值范围有明确规定，需遵守这些规定以保证兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00874</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>63</MAX>
                          <MIN>8</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:6da71784-b6df-457d-b8b1-c366ff0552fa">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMChannelPerPnc</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the ComMChannel that is required for this PNC.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMChannelPerPnc配置项用于定义网络管理中，每个部分网络（PNC, Partial Network Cluster）与通信通道（ComMChannel）之间的关系，确保正确的网络请求和释放策略被应用。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个PNC至少关联一个ComMChannel，以保证网络请求能够正确传递；不同PNC可以共享同一个ComMChannel，但需注意资源竞争和通信冲突；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中是一致的，但设计时应考虑网络管理策略的复杂性和系统资源限制。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">ImplementationType: NetworkHandleType</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00880</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>256</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/ComM/ComMConfigSet/ComMChannel</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:315ab814-5ceb-466c-ae1f-04a4427e3e6e">
                          <SHORT-NAME>ComMPncEthIfSwitchPortGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the PortGroups that correspond to this PNC. Note: This is only for documentation.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMPncEthIfSwitchPortGroupRef 是一个配置项，用于将PNC（Partial Network Cluster）与特定的以太网交换机端口组相关联，以便管理PNC的网络请求和释放。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMPncEthIfSwitchPortGroupRef时，必须确保引用的以太网交换机端口组已经在系统中定义并且与PNC的通信需求相匹配；此配置项对于实现PNC的网络管理功能至关重要，因此需要仔细检查其正确性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与其他网络管理配置项协同工作，以保证网络管理的一致性和有效性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00891</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
