                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:341c2dc9-b712-4783-9f7c-a5248add0108">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMResetAfterForcingNoComm</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">ComM shall perform a reset after entering &quot;No Communication&quot; mode because of an active mode limitation to &quot;No Communication&quot; mode.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMResetAfterForcingNoComm是一个配置项，用于指定通信管理模块（ComM）在强制进入No Communication状态后是否应该在下一个主周期自动重置状态。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保此配置项与系统的通信需求相一致；如果系统需要在某些情况下保持No Communication状态，不应启用自动重置；此配置项的使用应结合诊断和网络管理需求仔细考虑。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled
                                        false: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00558</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:35235a58-2a7e-4268-a93a-37dc5d45746e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMSynchronousWakeUp</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Wake up of one channel shall lead to a wake up of all channels if true.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMSynchronousWakeUp 配置项用于定义通信管理模块是否应在网络唤醒信号到达时立即唤醒ECU。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项确保了网络管理的及时响应性和系统的低延迟；配置时需考虑ECU的功耗和唤醒策略；不适当的配置可能导致ECU响应延迟或过度消耗电源。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled
                                        false: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00695</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>true</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2639fcad-20af-4d85-aa2d-ce65ecec04ad">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMVersionInfoApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the possibility to read the published information with the service ComM_GetPublishedInformation().</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMVersionInfoApi 用于启用或禁用通信管理模块的版本信息API，允许用户获取模块的版本信息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，通常建议启用此API以支持标准化的诊断和监控需求；确保在配置时正确设置此API以避免软件兼容性问题；在生产环境中，应仔细考虑是否公开版本信息，以防止潜在的安全风险。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled
                                        false: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00622</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:7d54078b-b946-4024-ba5c-43ab7cdb93bd">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMWakeupInhibitionEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">true if wake up inhibition functionality enabled.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMWakeupInhibitionEnabled 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用通信管理器（ComM）中的唤醒抑制功能，该功能允许系统在特定条件下抑制唤醒信号，以减少不必要的网络活动和功耗。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此参数时，需要确保它与系统的功耗和唤醒策略相匹配；如果启用唤醒抑制，必须仔细定义抑制条件以避免影响系统的响应性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保使用正确的模块和接口来配置和管理唤醒抑制功能。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: Enabled
                                        false: Disabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00559</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1cbe2590-ca34-4d84-985b-39a0fab8df28">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMPncPrepareSleepTimer</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Time in seconds the PNC state machine shall wait in COMM_PNC_PREPARE_SLEEP.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMPncPrepareSleepTimer配置项用于定义在部分网络控制器（PNC）进入准备睡眠状态之前需要等待的时间，以确保网络上的所有节点都有足够的时间来完成数据交换。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应根据网络的实际需求和性能来设置，以避免不必要的延迟或数据丢失；在设置时需考虑网络的拓扑结构和通信协议的特性；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的单位通常是毫秒，确保与系统的时间管理策略一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00841</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">63</MAX>
                      <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a03ca45f-4cb6-4775-8311-909b855c5f10">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMTMinFullComModeDuration</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Minimum time duration in seconds, spent in the COMM_FULL_COMMUNICATION sub-state COMM_FULL_COM_NETWORK_REQUESTED.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMTMinFullComModeDuration 是一个配置参数，用于定义ECU在全通信模式（Full Communication Mode）下必须保持的最小时间，以确保网络上的其他节点有足够的时间来识别ECU的存在。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该参数的设置需要考虑网络的总体性能和其他节点的需求；设置过短可能导致网络管理问题，设置过长可能影响系统的响应时间；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置应与网络管理需求和ECU的唤醒/睡眠行为相协调。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUint">s</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00557</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>5</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">65</MAX>
                      <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.001</MIN>
                    </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d34d3082-5711-4aa4-b750-071f85ef3eba">
                      <SHORT-NAME>ComMEcuGroupClassification</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines whether a mode inhibition affects the ECU or not.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：ComMEcuGroupClassification 配置项用于定义ECU组的分类，这有助于管理ECU间的通信和确保网络上不同ECU组之间的数据交换满足特定的分类要求。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置ComMEcuGroupClassification时，需要确保ECU组分类与系统设计和网络管理策略一致；分类应当反映出ECU之间的通信关系和数据交换的安全级别；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循预定义的分类枚举值，不应随意定义新的分类。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">3</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Examples:

                                        000: No mode inhibition can be activated

                                        001: Wake up inhibition can be enabled</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_ComM_00563</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
